  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요?</p><p>학기말이라 수업을 하긴 좀 그렇고, 또 안하기도 좀 그렇고해서</p><p>재해재난과 안전 단원 관련 영화 리뷰를 보고 행동요령을 정리할 목적으로 만들어 보았습니다.</p><p>행동요령은 <u><b>국민재난안전포털</b></u>에 나온 내용으로 정리해 보았고, 그 싸이트에 각 항목별 행동요령이 짧은 동영상으로도 있어서,</p><p>부족한 설명을 대신 할 수도 있을 것 같습니다.</p><p>보여주는 영상과 (20~30분 내외), 학습지 첨부합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 재난영화 뜯어보기 건축물붕괴편 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OEm9MOtXLno\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OEm9MOtXLno</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OEm9MOtXLno\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bpHNNx/hyMTGAFdA9/Q2TV7NSL1pIKJ2klKzel90/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OEm9MOtXLno\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>2. 재난영화 뜯어보기 화학물질유출편 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=262_wcvS8GU\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=262_wcvS8GU</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=262_wcvS8GU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/5t9Ou/hyMTL9NLPE/CfGFoMDNvayXdM88Bm60Sk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/262_wcvS8GU\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>3. 재난영화 뜯어보기 질병편 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ovRmjZo9dq0\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ovRmjZo9dq0</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ovRmjZo9dq0\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bgbyWc/hyMTIkUxE4/U9kwECrDWu8fkq1sCzD8Ek/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ovRmjZo9dq0\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>4. 재난영화 뜯어보기 비행기사고편 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ObSI2ZsiIE\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ObSI2ZsiIE</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0ObSI2ZsiIE\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"851\" data-video-height=\"479\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/gnTZv/hyMU05kXSn/BwSuxuGwrYcsfKbQZ56HFk/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=804_332_852_384\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"851\" data-video-origin-height=\"479\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0ObSI2ZsiIE\" width=\"851\" height=\"479\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b0db30bc9cd6fe1246fd47de5ed33ab58817be3?download\" data-file-name=